{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A  mix of <strong>Sokoban</strong>, <strong>sliding puzzles</strong>, and <strong>pipe-style</strong> circuits with snappy movement controls \u2014 all wrapped in the cozy, colorful world of tiny tech.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Tiny Circuits, you play as a tiny robot solving grid-based electrical puzzles inside an electronics factory. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connect circuit tiles to complete each puzzle circuit board.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-crafted levels with randomized elements for fresh challenges every playthrough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn sparks to unlock new puzzle tiles and levels as you make your way from &quot;new hire&quot; to &quot;Employee of the month&quot;! </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2709790?t=1768925314","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709790/98347b02ac505f4b8e373e2c7a3b517135ea2cd3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768925314","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709790/3ea58d66dd3fdc0cdb3c90941f70cc9a65bd628d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768925314","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709790/3ea58d66dd3fdc0cdb3c90941f70cc9a65bd628d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768925314","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4065300,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=